  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Hi there, dear creator!</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">We are an online retail and wholesale ecommerce store that aims to fulfill customers' wants and needs at </span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">BARGAIN</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">&nbsp;prices. You can visit our store here:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><a href