m, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/beginbargaining\">https://linktr.ee/beginbargaining</a></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">However, to sign up to our program is simple and only takes a few minutes. Once signed up, you'll </span><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">receive an affiliate link that you can share to all your socials. You'll earn a <strong>25%</strong> affiliate commission upon every sale that comes through you.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 33, 36); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">We believe that our commission rate for our products is truly competitive and outdoes many others in these trendy product sectors as this is where we are tapping into at the moment in the online space. We have motivated many others to join the bandwagon and the commissions that other collaborators are earning with us are exponentially higher and far greater than our competitors.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Contact us on WhatsApp on this number for more details: +447990598166</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Or alternatively through email: theteam@beginbargaining.com</p>",
